WEBVTT

00:02.350 --> 00:04.690
<b>Touko, I saw</b>

00:05.270 --> 00:06.970
<b>what you saw that day.</b>

00:09.560 --> 00:11.400
<b>What she saw?</b>

00:11.640 --> 00:13.440
<b>What are you to Touko?</b>

00:13.440 --> 00:14.210
<b>Hey—</b>

00:15.270 --> 00:17.410
<b>You came all the way here 
to see Touko again?</b>

00:17.410 --> 00:18.120
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:18.490 --> 00:19.610
<b>"Yeah"?</b>

00:20.170 --> 00:21.910
<b>How did you know to look here?</b>

00:21.910 --> 00:26.040
<b>Kazemichi</b>

00:22.380 --> 00:24.350
<b>This is where you hang out, isn't it?</b>

00:24.350 --> 00:25.630
<b>Yeah, so?</b>

00:26.570 --> 00:30.040
<b>I'll see you at the Kirinkan lookout at 11.</b>

00:31.070 --> 00:31.920
<b>What?</b>

00:31.920 --> 00:33.150
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

02:06.540 --> 02:08.140
<b>You don't have to go.</b>

02:08.440 --> 02:10.540
<b>What does it matter to you?</b>

02:10.540 --> 02:13.450
<b>That dude was so collected and curt.</b>

02:13.450 --> 02:17.160
<b>So what's your relationship 
with that "David"?</b>

02:17.160 --> 02:20.410
<b>We talked about chickens at school.</b>

02:20.410 --> 02:21.280
<b>Huh?</b>

02:21.640 --> 02:24.000
<b>How do you get from that 
to "let's meet tomorrow"?</b>

02:24.000 --> 02:25.080
<b>Well...</b>

02:25.080 --> 02:27.360
<b>He was pretty hot.</b>

02:27.360 --> 02:28.660
<b>Never mind that.</b>

02:29.240 --> 02:30.820
<b>You should go if you want.</b>

02:30.820 --> 02:34.420
<b>But I think it's what 
inside that makes a man.</b>

02:34.420 --> 02:36.800
<b>Seriously, it's not like that.</b>

02:36.800 --> 02:38.800
<b>Is something bothering you?</b>

02:40.230 --> 02:41.610
<b>I'll go too, then.</b>

02:41.610 --> 02:42.680
<b>Sacchan?!</b>

02:43.080 --> 02:45.390
<b>He didn't tell you to come alone, did he?</b>

02:45.390 --> 02:46.580
<b>Are you sure?</b>

02:46.580 --> 02:47.220
<b>Yeah.</b>

02:47.620 --> 02:50.740
<b>Why don't we all go then?</b>

02:50.740 --> 02:52.320
<b>That's not very thoughtful.</b>

02:53.050 --> 02:55.400
<b>You really don't understand girls.</b>

02:56.040 --> 02:57.660
<b>Why?!</b>

02:59.610 --> 03:03.530
<b>Episode 2
"Bench"</b>

03:08.850 --> 03:11.500
<b>What's there not to understand about girls?</b>

03:11.910 --> 03:13.670
<b>You want me to tell you?</b>

03:15.020 --> 03:15.750
<b>Ow!</b>

03:16.550 --> 03:18.780
<b>I told you not to come 
in without asking.</b>

03:18.780 --> 03:20.100
<b>It seemed like you called.</b>

03:20.100 --> 03:21.840
<b>Obviously not.</b>

03:22.510 --> 03:25.440
<b>A guy who understands girls is</b>

03:26.860 --> 03:30.460
<b>someone who's tall, rich,</b>

03:30.990 --> 03:32.660
<b>and smart.</b>

03:33.220 --> 03:36.630
<b>Psych, it's actually a guy who can tell 
a girl's lying when she says that.</b>

03:36.630 --> 03:37.640
<b>Good luck!</b>

04:29.350 --> 04:31.020
<b>Focus, focus.</b>

04:52.340 --> 04:54.350
<i>Have you found your fragment?</i>

05:00.860 --> 05:02.030
<b>I slipped up.</b>

05:02.330 --> 05:03.570
<b>Sorry,</b>

05:04.190 --> 05:06.070
<b>I couldn't get the room ready in time.</b>

05:06.070 --> 05:08.450
<b>I'll get it done by the end of the week.</b>

05:08.860 --> 05:11.830
<b>It's fine. I'm enjoying it.</b>

05:12.130 --> 05:14.910
<b>You mean camping out in a tent?</b>

05:15.190 --> 05:18.890
<b>Not much for me to do 
as your dad, then.</b>

05:18.890 --> 05:19.920
<b>Thanks.</b>

05:20.220 --> 05:21.080
<b>Oh,</b>

05:21.560 --> 05:24.210
<b>I'm leaving soon, so I won't need lunch.</b>

05:24.510 --> 05:25.880
<b>Yeah? A date?</b>

05:26.130 --> 05:26.840
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:28.690 --> 05:29.860
<b>It's pretty.</b>

05:30.690 --> 05:34.510
<b>I messed up a bit, so I had to fix it.</b>

05:34.810 --> 05:36.420
<b>Doesn't look like it.</b>

05:36.420 --> 05:37.440
<b>Will you keep it?</b>

05:38.440 --> 05:39.460
<b>Really?</b>

05:39.460 --> 05:41.280
<b>For sticking with me today.</b>

05:43.710 --> 05:44.810
<b>Thanks.</b>

05:47.940 --> 05:48.850
<b>Is that—</b>

05:49.920 --> 05:51.880
<b>Your first piece.</b>

05:53.230 --> 05:54.710
<b>Does that sparkly thing have something</b>

05:54.710 --> 05:56.830
<b>to do with why you're here today?</b>

06:06.820 --> 06:07.510
<b>Hey.</b>

06:07.960 --> 06:10.640
<b>Hello. We met yesterday.</b>

06:10.640 --> 06:11.970
<b>It's Nagamiya.</b>

06:12.510 --> 06:14.950
<b>Did you come here because 
you're worried about Touko?</b>

06:18.590 --> 06:20.820
<b>What can I do to earn your trust?</b>

06:20.820 --> 06:22.690
<b>Don't come near Touko-chan.</b>

06:24.050 --> 06:24.860
<b>That's not easy.</b>

06:25.890 --> 06:30.670
<b>What if I told you I could 
solve one of your problems?</b>

06:31.640 --> 06:34.320
<b>Touko, you see things on</b>

06:34.320 --> 06:36.120
<b>certain occasions, don't you?</b>

06:38.670 --> 06:39.760
<b>Sacchan.</b>

06:40.950 --> 06:43.690
<b>I want to talk with Okikura-kun.</b>

06:43.990 --> 06:44.840
<b>But...</b>

06:50.060 --> 06:51.190
<b>Sorry.</b>

06:52.820 --> 06:55.330
<b>You're going to help Touko-chan, right?</b>

06:55.630 --> 06:56.520
<b>I believe so.</b>

06:57.010 --> 06:58.210
<b>I'll wait downstairs.</b>

06:58.210 --> 06:58.930
<b>Okay.</b>

07:05.380 --> 07:06.390
<b>Oh yeah,</b>

07:06.740 --> 07:09.070
<b>we don't allow dating in our group.</b>

07:09.320 --> 07:10.080
<b>Eh?</b>

07:10.560 --> 07:13.280
<b>I don't think those kinds of things last.</b>

07:18.430 --> 07:21.680
<b>Touko, what do you think of your skill?</b>

07:21.980 --> 07:23.610
<b>My skill?</b>

07:23.610 --> 07:25.440
<b>Your <i>ability</i>, you might call it.</b>

07:26.200 --> 07:27.830
<b>Your hallucinations.</b>

07:29.290 --> 07:30.300
<b>Umm...</b>

07:31.320 --> 07:32.800
<b>Let's go outside.</b>

07:39.090 --> 07:40.220
<b>So hot.</b>

07:40.220 --> 07:42.770
<b>I want to apologize to you.</b>

07:43.910 --> 07:46.900
<b>Oh yeah, you didn't even 
ask me if I could come.</b>

07:47.390 --> 07:50.180
<b>What if I hadn't shown up?</b>

07:50.570 --> 07:52.990
<b>I would have gone to see you 
as many times as I'd need to.</b>

07:55.130 --> 07:57.380
<b>I got caught off-guard today.</b>

07:57.680 --> 07:59.930
<b>I heard your voice.</b>

08:00.230 --> 08:00.870
<b>Sorry.</b>

08:01.130 --> 08:02.870
<b>I don't get it.</b>

08:02.870 --> 08:06.180
<b>I heard your future voice 
without your permission.</b>

08:07.150 --> 08:09.870
<b>My voice from the future?</b>

08:09.870 --> 08:10.540
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:12.960 --> 08:14.710
<b>Are you apologizing because</b>

08:15.310 --> 08:18.770
<b>you heard me singing in the 
bathroom or something?</b>

08:19.210 --> 08:20.550
<b>Or—no way...</b>

08:20.550 --> 08:23.480
<b>I wasn't talking about 
my exam grades, was I?</b>

08:23.900 --> 08:25.210
<b>Neither.</b>

08:25.210 --> 08:26.500
<b>Oh, good.</b>

08:26.500 --> 08:27.240
<b>Are they bad?</b>

08:27.240 --> 08:27.900
<b>Huh?</b>

08:28.200 --> 08:29.250
<b>Your exam grades.</b>

08:29.250 --> 08:31.940
<b>Why would you even ask? 
You figure it out!</b>

08:32.400 --> 08:33.930
<b>So you believe me.</b>

08:33.930 --> 08:35.910
<b>I'll forgive you if you tell 
me you're kidding now.</b>

08:36.210 --> 08:37.630
<b>Three-second rule.</b>

08:38.210 --> 08:39.180
<b>I'm not kidding.</b>

08:41.770 --> 08:43.380
<b>On the day of the festival,</b>

08:43.870 --> 08:45.970
<b>for the first time,</b>

08:46.270 --> 08:48.210
<b>I both saw and heard a fragment.</b>

08:48.660 --> 08:49.730
<b>Fragment?</b>

08:51.940 --> 08:53.210
I've finally found you.

08:54.630 --> 08:57.340
<b>That was the first time I heard a voice.</b>

08:58.010 --> 08:59.970
<b>My voice from the future.</b>

08:59.970 --> 09:02.850
<b>I call it a fragment of the future.</b>

09:03.240 --> 09:04.840
<b>A fragment of the future?</b>

09:05.220 --> 09:07.160
<b>What you're seeing is the same.</b>

09:07.970 --> 09:09.820
<b>I can see the future?</b>

09:10.210 --> 09:11.020
<b>I believe so.</b>

09:11.020 --> 09:12.030
<b>How?</b>

09:12.800 --> 09:16.450
<b>Whenever you see things— 
there's a trigger, isn't there?</b>

09:16.750 --> 09:17.470
<b>Yes.</b>

09:17.770 --> 09:19.910
<b>That probably makes it easier to see.</b>

09:22.940 --> 09:24.800
<b>You just need glass?</b>

09:24.800 --> 09:25.640
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:25.990 --> 09:29.240
<b>Anything shiny, but especially glass.</b>

09:30.640 --> 09:31.960
<b>Then just</b>

09:32.540 --> 09:34.600
<b>focus on the glass.</b>

09:56.380 --> 09:59.020
<i>I want to see the future, too.</i>

10:04.870 --> 10:06.710
<b>Was that me?</b>

10:08.250 --> 10:12.170
<b>I knew it. I can see something 
when I'm near you, too.</b>

10:12.420 --> 10:15.670
<b>I've never seen anything so vividly.</b>

10:15.670 --> 10:17.170
<b>And voices, too.</b>

10:17.170 --> 10:20.590
<b>But how do you know that 
this is from the future?</b>

10:21.120 --> 10:22.960
<b>Because it was for me.</b>

10:24.640 --> 10:27.840
<b>See, when we're together,</b>

10:27.840 --> 10:29.330
<b>we can both see and hear.</b>

10:29.330 --> 10:30.980
<b>What do you do, knowing that?</b>

10:36.590 --> 10:38.550
<b>Hold on to this number.</b>

10:40.000 --> 10:43.200
<b>Is this... You're kidding, your landline?</b>

10:43.970 --> 10:46.700
<b>I don't think he's a bad person.</b>

10:46.980 --> 10:48.600
<b>But I can't seem to like him.</b>

10:48.600 --> 10:49.420
<b></b>

10:50.040 --> 10:51.890
<b>He didn't pull anything weird, did he?</b>

10:51.890 --> 10:53.200
<b>Of course not.</b>

10:53.200 --> 10:54.590
<b>Okay, then.</b>

10:55.210 --> 10:58.540
<b>If anyone ever caused you grief,</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:01.200
<b>I would never forgive them.</b>

11:11.660 --> 11:13.250
<b>It's my last chance.</b>

11:13.830 --> 11:15.430
<b>I gotta let her know.</b>

11:17.820 --> 11:19.820
Confession

11:18.070 --> 11:19.530
<b>For I am a man!</b>

11:20.110 --> 11:22.660
<b>Oh? "A man" you say?</b>

11:22.660 --> 11:24.940
<b>I won't tell you not to just barge in,</b>

11:24.940 --> 11:27.450
<b>but can't you at least 
think about the mood?</b>

11:27.830 --> 11:30.830
<b>Oh yeah, I saw that girl earlier.</b>

11:30.830 --> 11:31.730
<b>That one you like.</b>

11:31.730 --> 11:32.810
<b>Stop it!</b>

11:33.230 --> 11:35.550
<b>I saw her in the hospital.</b>

11:35.550 --> 11:36.670
<b>Is there something wrong?</b>

11:37.970 --> 11:39.950
<b>She goes there routinely.</b>

11:39.950 --> 11:42.420
<b>Star-crossed with a sickly beauty, huh?</b>

11:42.420 --> 11:43.510
<b>Sounds like your thing.</b>

11:43.810 --> 11:45.680
<b>No star-crossing us!</b>

12:12.090 --> 12:14.130
<b>Hey, we met yesterday.</b>

12:14.130 --> 12:14.910
<b>Yo.</b>

12:17.300 --> 12:19.110
<b>I'm Yukinari Imi.</b>

12:19.610 --> 12:21.760
<b>Kakeru Okikura.</b>

12:32.450 --> 12:33.580
<b>That was quick!</b>

12:34.560 --> 12:37.330
<b>Hey, are you pacing yourself?</b>

12:39.500 --> 12:40.930
<b>Here, drink up.</b>

12:43.340 --> 12:45.230
<b>You idiot, don't just ignore me!</b>

12:46.170 --> 12:48.650
<b>You were getting better.</b>

12:48.650 --> 12:50.700
<b>You really should pace yourself.</b>

12:51.880 --> 12:54.870
<b>Also, Hiro sent everyone an email.</b>

12:54.870 --> 12:56.040
<b>Take a look later.</b>

12:58.730 --> 12:59.830
<b>What?</b>

13:00.590 --> 13:01.890
<b>I saw David.</b>

13:01.890 --> 13:02.720
<b>David?</b>

13:03.310 --> 13:04.950
<b>Oh, from yesterday.</b>

13:06.330 --> 13:07.130
<b>And?</b>

13:08.410 --> 13:09.300
<b>I don't want to lose.</b>

13:10.700 --> 13:12.770
<b>What? I couldn't hear.</b>

13:19.760 --> 13:20.770
<b>Hello?</b>

13:21.350 --> 13:23.480
<i>Touko? It's me.</i>

13:23.480 --> 13:26.460
<b>Yeah, what's up, Yana-chan?</b>

13:26.890 --> 13:28.670
<i>I wanted to talk about something.</i>

13:28.670 --> 13:29.490
<b>Sure.</b>

13:30.210 --> 13:34.130
<i>I'm thinking of confessing.</i>

13:34.950 --> 13:35.620
<b>Yeah?</b>

13:36.410 --> 13:38.720
<b>Do you know who to?</b>

13:39.990 --> 13:41.040
<i>Umm...</i>

13:41.040 --> 13:41.900
<b>Guess.</b>

13:41.900 --> 13:43.150
<i>Yuki-kun?</i>

13:43.770 --> 13:45.060
<b>You knew, didn't you?</b>

13:45.380 --> 13:47.740
<i>I always thought you'd 
be cute together.</i>

13:47.740 --> 13:49.120
<i>Yana-chan and Yuki-kun.</i>

13:49.430 --> 13:50.790
<b>But I think</b>

13:51.390 --> 13:53.020
<b>there's someone he likes.</b>

13:53.020 --> 13:55.390
<i>Yana-chan, of course!</i>

13:55.390 --> 13:58.560
<i>Maybe you should get ready 
for him to confess to you.</i>

13:59.090 --> 14:01.640
<b>Say what? Get ready how?</b>

14:02.130 --> 14:03.400
<i>Um...</i>

14:03.900 --> 14:06.750
<i>I don't even know if it's me.</i>

14:06.750 --> 14:08.730
<b>I swear, it'll be fine.</b>

14:09.230 --> 14:10.910
<i>If it doesn't work out,</i>

14:11.320 --> 14:14.120
<b>I'll have to leave the group.</b>

14:15.040 --> 14:16.460
<b>That's not true.</b>

14:16.950 --> 14:17.920
<i>Yeah?</i>

14:17.920 --> 14:19.120
<b>Of course not.</b>

14:19.120 --> 14:22.460
<b>Take control. You're awesome.</b>

14:22.460 --> 14:24.370
<i>I'm rooting for you.</i>

14:24.370 --> 14:25.040
<b></b>

14:25.420 --> 14:26.820
<b>Thanks, Touko.</b>

14:27.760 --> 14:29.670
<i>Hey, bath's open.</i>

14:31.600 --> 14:32.350
<b>Bath?</b>

14:32.910 --> 14:35.990
<b>No, no, not like they're bathing together.</b>

14:39.630 --> 14:43.090
<b>How would you get ready 
to be confessed to?</b>

14:43.460 --> 14:45.600
<b>Onee-chan, dinner!</b>

14:45.600 --> 14:46.940
<b>Okay.</b>

14:49.040 --> 14:49.990
<b>Getting ready...</b>

14:53.810 --> 14:55.950
<b>Let's eat!</b>

14:57.000 --> 14:58.580
<b>Fried chicken, huh?</b>

14:58.580 --> 15:00.240
<b>I had a craving.</b>

15:00.240 --> 15:03.710
<b>We bought too much chicken. 
The freezer was packed.</b>

15:04.020 --> 15:07.090
<b>Onee-chan, you went to 
Kirinkan today, right?</b>

15:07.390 --> 15:08.410
<b>How was it?</b>

15:09.990 --> 15:12.410
<b>I wish the balcony had a cooler, too.</b>

15:13.450 --> 15:15.940
<b>Kirinkan is a special place</b>

15:15.940 --> 15:18.240
<b>for us, isn't it, Marie?</b>

15:18.240 --> 15:18.950
<b></b>

15:19.270 --> 15:21.310
<b>Twenty years ago,</b>

15:21.610 --> 15:24.530
<b>Marie was frantically copying 
the display pieces.</b>

15:24.530 --> 15:26.770
<b>She forgot to breathe and collapsed,</b>

15:26.770 --> 15:29.080
<b>and it was Dad that came to the rescue.</b>

15:29.420 --> 15:31.160
<b>I don't get it.</b>

15:31.590 --> 15:34.130
<b>I propped her up, and when 
she came to, she said,</b>

15:34.440 --> 15:37.190
<b>"You climbed all those stairs for me."</b>

15:37.190 --> 15:39.220
<b>So I said,</b>

15:39.220 --> 15:41.550
<b>"Nah, it was like going down stairs."</b>

15:42.890 --> 15:44.920
<b>Man, I'm embarrassed.</b>

15:44.920 --> 15:47.100
<b>Mom, is that true?</b>

15:47.100 --> 15:48.670
<b>Don't remember a thing.</b>

15:51.310 --> 15:52.680
<b>Hey, Hina-chan,</b>

15:52.680 --> 15:56.190
<b>if... if you could know the future,</b>

15:56.190 --> 15:57.240
<b>what would you do?</b>

15:57.240 --> 16:00.020
<b>That's so random. Well...</b>

16:00.600 --> 16:02.650
<b>I'd make a killing on boat races.</b>

16:02.650 --> 16:03.660
<b>Huh?</b>

16:03.660 --> 16:06.940
<b>Like, if you're married or 
whatever. That kind of stuff.</b>

16:07.190 --> 16:09.570
<b>What would be the fun in knowing that?</b>

16:09.570 --> 16:11.570
<b>How about after you grow up, then?</b>

16:17.620 --> 16:19.430
<b>She says she can't make it today.</b>

16:19.430 --> 16:21.320
<b>Her lesson's taking a while.</b>

16:21.320 --> 16:23.430
<b>How was yesterday, Sacchan?</b>

16:24.630 --> 16:26.940
<b>He wasn't any different from</b>

16:26.940 --> 16:29.270
<b>when he was here last time.</b>

16:29.570 --> 16:31.760
<b>I think they were just talking.</b>

16:32.180 --> 16:34.090
<b>What do you mean, you think?</b>

16:34.410 --> 16:36.360
<b>I left the room.</b>

16:36.730 --> 16:38.460
<b>You left them alone together?</b>

16:40.650 --> 16:42.240
<b>I'm finally here!</b>

16:42.240 --> 16:43.910
<b>Huh, what's wrong?</b>

16:45.450 --> 16:47.920
<b>So as per my email,</b>

16:47.920 --> 16:49.870
<b>we're going hiking tomorrow.</b>

16:50.680 --> 16:53.420
<b>First, about our meet-up time—</b>

16:53.420 --> 16:56.370
<b>Before that, there's something 
I want to announce.</b>

16:56.370 --> 16:57.130
<b>Proceed.</b>

16:58.870 --> 17:01.580
<b>We're open to dating.</b>

17:05.100 --> 17:06.960
<b>We were banned from dating?</b>

17:06.960 --> 17:07.790
<b>Yup.</b>

17:07.790 --> 17:09.310
<b>But from now on—</b>

17:09.310 --> 17:10.670
<b>Hold up!</b>

17:13.000 --> 17:15.120
<b>Wait, never mind.</b>

17:15.120 --> 17:16.090
<b>Yuki-kun,</b>

17:20.020 --> 17:21.220
<b>I'm ready, too!</b>

17:29.770 --> 17:30.920
<b>Welcome.</b>

17:31.220 --> 17:33.270
<b>Huh, Yanagi-san.</b>

17:33.270 --> 17:35.020
<b>Everyone left already.</b>

17:35.020 --> 17:36.280
<b>Oh.</b>

17:36.280 --> 17:39.060
<b>I finished early, 
so I thought I'd drop by.</b>

17:39.060 --> 17:40.660
<b>I'm going to chill for a bit.</b>

17:45.600 --> 17:49.010
<b>Ask Yukinari about tomorrow.</b>

17:49.010 --> 17:50.720
<b>Okay, thanks.</b>

17:50.720 --> 17:51.930
<b>Your order?</b>

17:51.930 --> 17:53.230
<b>Apple tea.</b>

17:53.230 --> 17:54.130
<b>Roger.</b>

17:56.550 --> 17:59.380
<b>Oh, and an announcement from Touko-san.</b>

18:00.460 --> 18:03.100
<b>We're open to dating.</b>

18:06.420 --> 18:08.420
<b>Sorry, I just remembered something.</b>

18:14.480 --> 18:16.320
<b>Okay, Yuki-kun, see you.</b>

18:16.320 --> 18:17.090
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:20.870 --> 18:21.490
<b>Touko.</b>

18:22.340 --> 18:23.480
<b>Yes?</b>

18:23.480 --> 18:25.450
<b>Can we talk?</b>

18:30.670 --> 18:32.510
<b>It's so hot again today.</b>

18:32.830 --> 18:34.030
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:34.610 --> 18:36.390
<b>Sorry, what were we saying?</b>

18:36.690 --> 18:40.690
<b>Erm, well, you were with David yesterday.</b>

18:40.690 --> 18:41.720
<b>Yesterday?</b>

18:41.720 --> 18:44.690
<b>Oh yeah, did you get it already?</b>

18:44.690 --> 18:46.230
<b>Get it? What?</b>

18:48.820 --> 18:50.810
<b>Oh, I mean, a talk.</b>

18:51.100 --> 18:53.270
<b>Talk? You did?</b>

18:53.270 --> 18:54.410
<b>Yeah,</b>

18:54.410 --> 18:56.510
<b>maybe you can't be nice to</b>

18:56.510 --> 19:00.290
<b>girls straight-up because 
you're so shy, but...</b>

19:01.150 --> 19:03.830
<b>No, I mean, you're nice,</b>

19:03.830 --> 19:07.800
<b>but some things you can't 
get across without saying.</b>

19:07.800 --> 19:09.490
<b>It hasn't gotten across, has it?</b>

19:09.490 --> 19:13.380
<b>Why not try being honest with 
the people you care for?</b>

19:29.990 --> 19:31.500
<b>You're right,</b>

19:32.130 --> 19:33.490
<b>I have to say it out loud.</b>

19:33.490 --> 19:34.460
<b>Yup, yup.</b>

19:36.400 --> 19:37.320
<b>I—</b>

19:39.060 --> 19:41.080
<b>Touko, I...</b>

19:42.020 --> 19:44.950
<b>Wait, why are you telling me this?</b>

19:44.950 --> 19:45.930
<b>Touko!</b>

19:45.930 --> 19:46.580
<b>Yes!</b>

19:47.550 --> 19:49.550
<b>I like</b>

19:50.260 --> 19:51.080
<b>you.</b>

19:54.580 --> 19:58.050
<b>I like you, Touko!</b>

20:01.120 --> 20:03.440
<b>Th-Thanks.</b>

20:09.650 --> 20:11.300
<b>U-Um...</b>

20:16.690 --> 20:17.570
<b>Thanks!</b>

20:49.210 --> 20:50.310
<b>Yuki.</b>

20:53.470 --> 20:55.900
<b>What's wrong? You look all doofy.</b>

20:56.300 --> 20:58.280
<b>Why are you here?</b>

20:58.280 --> 21:01.780
<b>What? Seriously? I'm on my way home.</b>

21:02.110 --> 21:03.110
<b>Yeah?</b>

21:03.960 --> 21:05.870
<b>Yeah. Sorry.</b>

21:05.870 --> 21:08.230
<b>You're weird. Come on, let's go.</b>

21:18.750 --> 21:21.280
<b>What do I do? What do I do?</b>

21:21.280 --> 21:22.420
<b>I have to do something.</b>

21:24.370 --> 21:25.430
<b>Oh!</b>

21:41.590 --> 21:43.150
<b>Okikura here.</b>

21:43.420 --> 21:44.330
<b>Hey, um...</b>

21:44.330 --> 21:47.390
<b>Hi, it's Fukami, from school.</b>

21:47.390 --> 21:49.140
<i>Oh, it's me.</i>

21:49.140 --> 21:51.620
<b>Oh, Okikura-kun, hey,</b>

21:52.580 --> 21:55.500
<b>I want to see the future.</b>

21:56.040 --> 21:58.500
<b><i>I want to see the future, too.</i></b>

23:31.440 --> 23:32.590
<b>Hey, Yana-chan...</b>

23:32.590 --> 23:33.710
<b>A token of our friendship.</b>

23:33.710 --> 23:35.060
<b>Huh, really?</b>

23:35.060 --> 23:36.780
<b>But they're someone I like.</b>

23:36.780 --> 23:38.300
<b>Everyone, stand back!</b>

23:37.640 --> 23:40.440
<b>Episode 3
"Utility Tank"</b>
